GRANT SELECT ON ChiNhanh TO Role_ThuNgan;
GRANT SELECT ON KhoHang TO Role_ThuNgan;
GRANT SELECT ON TonKho TO Role_ThuNgan;
GRANT SELECT ON SanPham TO Role_ThuNgan;
